severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-03-29","finding":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control: A caregiver showed poor judgement when sharing information of an incident occurring at the center with someone outside the center, instead of with the director. This type of action prevents necessary intervention when incidents occur in the center.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026654844","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control (26 TAC §746.1201(1))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-98335-i20230223-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1203-3-d","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-98335-i20230223","date":"2023-02-23","original_code":"746.1203(3)(D)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-03-29","finding":"Personal use of electronic devices, such as cell phones, MP3 players, tablets, and video games: It was found that a caregiver used their personal device during the nap period to send messages to persons outside the center while counted in ratio as the caregiver, which reduces the caregivers ability to supervise adequately.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026640117","violation_type_title":"Personal use of electronic devices, such as cell phones, MP3 players, tablets, and video games (26 TAC §746.1203(3)(D))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-98335-i20230223-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2805-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-98335-i20230223","date":"2023-02-23","original_code":"746.2805(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-03-29","finding":"Prohibited Punishments - Corporal Punishment: A caregiver used corporal punishment on one child by striking the child on their